@startuml UC003_Delete_Project_Sequence
!theme plain
title UC003 — Confirm and delete a project

actor "Portfolio owner" as Owner
participant "public/js/app.js" as App
participant "public/js/api.js" as Client
participant "src/server.js" as Server
participant "src/routes/project.routes.js" as API
participant "src/middleware/requireAuth.js" as Auth
participant "src/services/projectService.js" as Service
participant "src/db/database.js" as Data
participant "src/services/fileStorageService.js" as Files
database PostgreSQL as DB

Owner -> App : Delete project
App --> Owner : Ask for confirmation
Owner -> App : Confirm deletion
App -> Client : Delete the saved project
Client -> Server : DELETE /api/projects/:id\nBearer token and If-Match
Server -> API : Dispatch through the projects router
API -> Auth : Verify active session
Auth --> API : Set req.user
API -> Service : Delete the owned project
Service -> Data : Delete for owner and expected revision
Data -> DB : Capture file IDs and delete project and associations
DB --> Data : Commit succeeded
Data --> Service : Removed project file IDs
Service -> Files : Remove stored files after commit
Service --> API : Project deleted
API --> Client : 204 No Content
Client --> App : Deletion confirmed
App --> Owner : Return to the studio list
@enduml
